# Changes to CI, the release gate, its checkers, the policies they enforce, the claims and inventories they
# compare against, and the database tests need the owner's review (ADR-0008). In a one-person project the
# workflow-guard job (base checkers judge the change) is what actually holds; CODEOWNERS adds the review
# once a second account exists. Replace @OWNER_HANDLE during first setup (docs/setup_guide.md, step 3).
/.github/                              @OWNER_HANDLE
/tools/                                @OWNER_HANDLE
/policies/                             @OWNER_HANDLE
/evals/                                @OWNER_HANDLE
/db/migrations/                        @OWNER_HANDLE
/db/tests/                             @OWNER_HANDLE
/db/local/                             @OWNER_HANDLE
/docs/claims.yaml                      @OWNER_HANDLE
/docs/error_codes.yaml                 @OWNER_HANDLE
/docs/security_definer_inventory.md    @OWNER_HANDLE
/requirements-ci.txt                   @OWNER_HANDLE
/VERSION                               @OWNER_HANDLE
